ud2.3:2.1 | S: Then, understanding this matter, on that occasion the Buddha expressed this heartfelt sentiment: | T: Then, on realizing the significance of that, the Blessed One on that occasion exclaimed:
ud2.3:3.1 | S: “Creatures love happiness, | T: (none)
ud2.3:3.2 | S: so if you harm them with a stick | T: Whoever hits with a stick
ud2.3:3.3 | S: in search of your own happiness, | T: (none)
