ud2.3:4.1 | S: Creatures love happiness, | T: (none)
ud2.3:4.2 | S: so if you don’t harm them with a stick | T: Whoever doesn’t hit with a stick beings desiring ease,
ud2.3:4.3 | S: in search of your own happiness, | T: when he himself is looking for ease,
ud2.3:4.4 | S: after death you will find happiness.” | T: will meet with ease after death.
ud2.3:4.5 | P: Tatiyaṁ. | T: (none)

